    "label": {
      "en": "Personal Tax Allowance (Minimo Personal)"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tin_perall_amt1"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Amount of Spain's basic Personal Tax Allowance ('Minimo Personal', the state 'Minimo por contribuyente'/individual component of the IRPF's tax-free minimum), currently 5,550 euro/year. Used as the comp_perElig parameter of BenCalc in tinit_es ('National Personal Tax Allowance') and the comp_perTU parameter in tinjt_es, it forms the base personal amount effectively taxed at 0% before the tax schedule is applied. The Country Report's Table 2.79 confirms the State 'Individual tax credit (Minimo por contribuyente)' at 5,550 euro/year, unchanged from 2022 to 2025 (with additional age-related top-ups for taxpayers over 65/75 not captured by this constant)."
    },
